---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import profile from '../data/profile.json';
---
<Base title="About Ilian Aigner — Sales, Entrepreneurship & STRK" description="Meet Ilian Aigner: from Hamburg to the University of Delaware, building STRK and pursuing U.S. B2B sales internships." kind="about">
  <header class="about-hero shell">
    <div class="about-hero-copy"><p class="section-label">About / Ilian Aigner</p><h1>Ambitious.<br />Still learning.</h1><p>I learned to lead on a basketball court in Hamburg. Now I’m building STRK and pursuing a career in B2B sales.</p><div class="about-hero-links"><a href="/work/">View my work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/ilian-aigner-cv.pdf" download>Download CV <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div>
    <figure class="about-hero-photo"><img src="/assets/images/ilian-portrait-shirt-700.jpg" width="700" height="700" alt="Portrait of Ilian Aigner in a navy suit" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption>Hamburg <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> Delaware</figcaption></figure>
  </header>

  <section class="about-story shell" aria-label="My story">
    <article class="about-chapter about-origin"><p class="section-label">Hamburg / Before Delaware</p><div><h2>Change the explanation.<br />Keep the standard.</h2><figure class="about-age-lesson"><div class="about-age-pair" aria-hidden="true"><strong>6</strong><span></span><strong>16</strong></div><figcaption>A six-year-old and a sixteen-year-old don’t need the same explanation.</figcaption></figure><p>At Walddörfer SV, I coached children and teenagers. That taught me to adjust how I communicate to the person in front of me.</p></div></article>
    <article class="about-chapter about-delaware"><p class="section-label">Delaware / Now</p><div><h2>Get past<br />the pitch.</h2><p>I want to understand what makes a client act, explain complex ideas clearly, and earn trust when it matters. At the University of Delaware, I’m studying entrepreneurship with minors in Professional Sales &amp; Sales Management and Marketing. I expect to graduate in Fall 2028.</p></div></article>
    <aside class="about-personal-pause" aria-labelledby="personal-heading"><div><p class="section-label">Outside work</p><h2 id="personal-heading">Different places.<br />Different conversations.</h2></div><div class="about-personal-copy"><p>I’m drawn to basketball, travel, and conversations that take me beyond my own perspective.</p><ul aria-label="Languages I speak"><li>Deutsch</li><li>English</li><li>Français</li></ul></div></aside>
    <article class="about-chapter about-proof"><p class="section-label">Putting it to work</p><div><h2>Put it under pressure.</h2><figure class="about-result"><strong>Top 20</strong><figcaption>Semi-finalist<br />Lerner Sales Competition</figcaption></figure><p>The competition put me in a simulated client conversation. At Horbach, I supported lead qualification and saw how experienced advisors approached client needs. Co-founding STRK gives me something of my own to build and test.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/work/">Explore the work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
  </section>

  <section class="about-next shell"><div><p class="section-label">What’s next</p><h2>A sales team<br />to grow with.</h2></div><div><p>I’m seeking a U.S. B2B sales, SDR, or BDR internship where I can learn quickly and contribute early.</p><nav class="about-next-actions" aria-label="Contact options"><a class="button button-primary" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>Email me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="about-next-link" href={profile.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Connect on LinkedIn">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav></div></section>
</Base>
